NOTE ON PROVENANCE

The OEM IPMI command this tool drives
(`ipmitool raw 0x2e 0x44 0xfd 0x19 0x00 <fan> 0x01 <duty>`) was discovered and
published by the community, not by this project:

  * Chiphell thread by wangmice:
    https://www.chiphell.com/thread-2604921-1-1.html
  * https://github.com/BiteMeIfYouCan/TYANS8030FAN
  * https://github.com/sonmihpc/AutoFan

This implementation is independent and shares no code with those projects.
